.TH "mceliece-fulltest" "1" "" "" ""
.hy
.SS NAME
.PP
mceliece-fulltest - run the full libmceliece test suite
.SS SYNOPSIS
.IP
.nf
\f[C]
mceliece-fulltest
\f[R]
.fi
.SS DESCRIPTION
.PP
\f[V]mceliece-fulltest\f[R] runs the full suite of tests of the
libmceliece implementation of the Classic McEliece cryptosystem.
.PP
The \f[V]mceliece-fulltest\f[R] output format is subject to change.
A successful test prints a final line saying
.IP
.nf
\f[C]
full tests succeeded
\f[R]
.fi
.PP
and exits 0.
An unsuccessful test exits nonzero without printing that line.
.SS SEE ALSO
.PP
\f[B]mceliece-test\f[R](1), \f[B]mceliece\f[R](1), \f[B]mceliece\f[R](3)
